    "description": "This data set contains information related to the collection of waste at the\ncoast of Cape Shirreff, Livingston Island. The material collected corresponds\nonly to the wastes generated off-shore as a result of fishing, tourist,\nlogistical activities, etc. The beached material has been  categorized\naccording to  the activities that generated the wastes, country of origin,\nconcentration and geographical distribution.       .",
